        "name": "Blade's End",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Talon's spells Wound champions and large monsters, stacking up to 3 times. When Talon attacks a champion with 3 stacks of Wound, they bleed for heavy damage over time.",
        "bodyHtml": "Talon's Abilities apply a stack to champions and large jungle monsters they damage for 6 seconds (max 3 stacks).<br /><br />When Talon Attacks a target with 3 stacks, he deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((80 ~ 280) + ([[si:scalead]]210% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> over 2 seconds.",
