      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "TalonQ",
        "name": "Noxian Diplomacy",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Talon stabs the target unit. If they are within melee range, this attack deals critical damage. If they are outside melee range, Talon will leap at his target before stabbing them. Talon refunds some health and cooldown if this ability kills the target.",
        "bodyHtml": "Talon leaps to a target and deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(65/85/105/125/145 + ([[si:scalead]]100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. If used in melee range, this Ability instead critically strikes for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(65/85/105/125/145 + ([[si:scalead]]100% bonus Attack Damage)) × (1.5 + [[si:scalecritmult]]100% bonus Critical Strike Damage) physical damage</span>.<br /><br />If this Ability kills the target, Talon restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(9 ~ 55) Health</span> and refunds 50% of its Cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Melee damage is affected by Critical Strike Damage increase.</span>",
