        "name": "Rake",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Talon sends out a volley of daggers that then return back to him, dealing physical damage every time it passes through an enemy. The returning blades deal bonus damage and slow units hit.",
        "bodyHtml": "Talon tosses a volley of blades, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/60/70/80/90 + ([[si:scalead]]40% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. The blades then return to him, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + ([[si:scalead]]90% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 40/45/50/55/60% for 1 second.",
